  {
    "id": 34928,
    "name": "Ascii",
    "slug": "ascii",
    "former_names": [
      "Ascii box"
    ],
    "small_logo_thumb_url": "https://bookface-images.s3.amazonaws.com/small_logos/7ab4963f9bacc76a0a31b94f8773cad5138d2dc3.png",
    "website": "https://box.ascii.dev",
    "all_locations": "Remote",
    "long_description": "**Problem**\r\n\r\nHumans used to need laptops to do their work. Now they prompt agents instead, and those agents need computers too: always-on, in large quantities, and with unlimited capabilities. \r\n\r\nBuilding and maintaining that yourself is far from trivial.\r\n\r\n**Solution**\r\n\r\nBox provides powerful, simple, permissive Ubuntu VMs in the cloud. In a box, an agent can work for long periods on code or on knowledge work like legal, research, reporting, and auditing.\r\n\r\n**Why Box and not any other cloud VM?**\r\n\r\n1. It is ready out of the box: every box ships with a desktop, chrome, languages, docker, snapshots, and templates, plus a CLI, SDK, API, and control pane for your fleet.\r\n2. It is permissive and paradigm agnostic: any number of agents can use any number of boxes. Agents can run inside or use boxes as an external tool.\r\n3. It is expertly crafted: we manage everything from the individual CPU to the orchestration software, which makes boxes stable, persistent, scalable, and secure.\r\n4. It is the best performance and price in town: our CPUs rank first on HPC benchmarks, and boxes are typically 9x to 18x cheaper than other leading sandboxes.\r\n\r\n**Further notes**\r\n\r\nBoxes are hosted in Europe, which keeps prices low, and more regions are coming. Unless compliance requires it, agents don't notice the region they run in.",
    "one_liner": "The best cloud VMs for billions of agents",
    "team_size": 3,
